        'content' => '<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:windowtext !msorm\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Vá»«a qua, Bá»‡nh viá»‡n Qu&acirc;n y 7, Cá»¥c Háº­u cáº§n</span></span></em></span><span style=\"color:windowtext !msorm\"><em> </em></span><span style=\"color:windowtext !msorm\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">-</span></span></em></span><span style=\"color:windowtext !msorm\"><em> </em></span><span style=\"color:windowtext !msorm\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Ká»¹ thuáº­t, Qu&acirc;n khu 3 vá»«a cáº¥p cá»©u th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng trÆ°á»ng há»£p bá»‡nh nh&acirc;n gáº§n 100 tuá»•i bá»‹ thá»§ng á»• lo&eacute;t hang vá»‹ dáº¡ d&agrave;y.</span></span></em></span></span></p>

